273f Multiple camera angles;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Simple and flexible gameplay;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Immersive world and rich animations;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Unique and customizable protagonist; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f English and French voices performed by Midnight Datura, Pixie Willow, and Steve Hamm; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f Two scenarios to play the adventure: The Enchanted Forest and the Chamber of Delights;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u273f High quality accessible to everyone, from any browser, desktop or mobile. No powerful machine is needed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307500/extras/Artemisia_Steam_Extra.png?t=1740574255\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2307500?t=1740574255","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740574255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307500/8d41b170fa0a18d343f532b78ed00b69b21b52d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740574255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307500/8d41b170fa0a18d343f532b78ed00b69b21b52d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740574255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"SUVI THE BLOSSOMING LUST is a fully 3D-animated game, and extremely explicit sexual content, crafted with high artistic care, aiming to be female-friendly, authentic, and immersive, without compromising an erotic experience.\r\nThis game also includes the cutest dimples and addictive beauty, brought to life with gorgeous voice acting, play it at your own risk!"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Laurinor, a land beyond the se